---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const sshThingPrivacy = {
  title: 'Privacy Policy for SSH THING (Windows)',
  lastUpdated: 'March 7, 2026',
  backLink: '/landing/sshthing'
};
---
<Layout
  title={sshThingPrivacy.title}
  description='Privacy Policy for SSH THING (Windows) - local-first data handling and secure storage'
>
  <section class="py-16 px-6 bg-[var(--color-bg)] text-white">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <a href={sshThingPrivacy.backLink} class="inline-block mb-8 text-green-500 hover:underline">← Back to SSH THING Landing Page</a>
      <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold mb-4 font-[var(--font-mono)]">{sshThingPrivacy.title}</h1>
      <p class="text-gray-400 mb-8">Last updated: {sshThingPrivacy.lastUpdated}</p>

      <div class="space-y-8">
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 font-[var(--font-mono)]">Summary</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-300">
            <li>The App does not send your data to developer-controlled servers.</li>
            <li>The App connects to SSH servers you configure and third-party CDNs for assets.</li>
            <li>Connection details and settings are stored locally; secrets in Windows credential store.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 font-[var(--font-mono)]">Information the App Processes</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-300">
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2">A. Data you enter or save (stored locally)</h3>
              <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
                <li>Saved server profiles (nickname, host, port, username, timeout settings)</li>
                <li>Snippets/actions you create</li>
                <li>Known host key/trust decisions</li>
                <li>Local UI preferences (terminal settings)</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2">B. Credentials and secrets (Windows security features)</h3>
              <p>Passwords and private keys stored using Windows credential store / OS keychain mechanisms (not plain text).</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2">C. SSH session data (in memory during use)</h3>
              <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-1">
                <li>Terminal input/output and remote session content</li>
                <li>Network metadata inherent to SSH connections</li>
              </ul>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2">D. Clipboard data (optional feature)</h3>
              <p>May write text to clipboard via OSC 52 sequences (handled locally on your device).</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 font-[var(--font-mono)]">Network Connections</h2>
          <div class="space-y-4 text-gray-300">
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2">A. SSH connections to your servers</h3>
              <p>App connects to configured SSH hosts; third-party server operators may log activity per their policies.</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2">B. Loading third-party assets (CDNs)</h3>
              <p>UI may load assets from third-party providers (Google Fonts, jsDelivr) that receive standard request data.</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2">C. Opening external links</h3>
              <p>External links open in your default browser; third-party site privacy policies apply.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 font-[var(--font-mono)]">How the App Uses Data</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300">Only to provide SSH connectivity, save local configuration, store credentials securely, and support clipboard integration.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 font-[var(--font-mono)]">Data Sharing</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300">Ken Taylor / Lugetech does not receive your data; third parties may receive data as described in Network Connections.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 font-[var(--font-mono)]">Data Retention</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-300">
            <li>Local configuration remains until deleted/uninstalled.</li>
            <li>Credentials in Windows credential store remain until removed via App/Windows settings.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 font-[var(--font-mono)]">Security</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-300">
            <li>Relies on OS secure storage for secrets.</li>
            <li>SSH traffic encrypted per SSH protocol.</li>
            <li>No method of storage/transmission is 100% secure; use trusted hosts and update your system.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 font-[var(--font-mono)]">Your Choices</h2>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-300">
            <li>Choose servers to connect to and information to save.</li>
            <li>Remove saved data or uninstall the App to delete local files.</li>
            <li>Manage stored credentials through Windows security settings.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 font-[var(--font-mono)]">Children’s Privacy</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300">The App is not directed to children under 13; intended for general productivity use.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 font-[var(--font-mono)]">Changes to This Policy</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300">Last updated date will be revised for changes; material changes may be noted in release notes.</p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 font-[var(--font-mono)]">Contact</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300">Ken Taylor / Lugetech<br>
          Email: <a href="mailto:kentaylorappdev@gmail.com" class="text-green-500 hover:underline">kentaylorappdev@gmail.com</a><br>
          Website: <a href="https://www.kentaylor.dev" class="text-green-500 hover:underline">www.kentaylor.dev</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>